My mother smiles.
She says, "Maya, we miss you."
My father waves his hand.
He says, "Maya, take care."
My sister Sofia also smiles.
My brother Diego says, "Goodbye."
Lola also barks once.
I say, "I miss everyone too."
I say, "See you next week."
They all say goodbye.
I wave my hand.
I end the video call.
I close my laptop.
The screen becomes dark.
There is quiet in my room now.
There is not even one sound here.
I am alone here.
I think of my family.
